Third-party material
====================

OpenNord (AGPL-3.0-or-later)
  https://github.com/simonflore/opennord, commit ed66f7f.
  tools/ns4data/_layout_ns4.py and _tables_ns4.py, and
  web/src/ns4/generated/layout-ns4.ts and tables-ns4.ts, are generated from
  OpenNord's TypeScript tables by tools/gen_layouts.py;
  web/src/editor/generated/display-ns4.ts is generated from them by
  tools/gen_editor_tables.py. The CBIN container rules and the block-chain
  decoding in web/src/ns4/, and the label lookup order of
  tools/ns4data/labels.py and its port in the editor, follow OpenNord's code
  (src/lib/clavia, src/lib/ns4).

ns4decode by Randy, with ns4gui by guyd789 (MIT)
  OpenNord's Stage 4 offset map, value tables and name tables, which reach the
  generated files above, are ported from ns4decode.
  templates/regressionTest.ns4p, bundled as
  web/src/ns4/generated/template-bytes.ts, is ns4decode's regression fixture.

